      "text_sha256": "ba1026d7e34c7d25733c60ffe77287249bd0a9f7ea1ebb79ccad274115142166",
      "text": "NYC DOT, in coordination with the MTA and the Port Authority of New York and New Jersey, recently installed an eastbound center-running bus lane on Broadway in Queens between 69th Street and Roosevelt Avenue. The bus lane will speed up bus service for approximately 9,000 daily riders on the Q70 SBS and provide improved transportation from LaGuardia Airport to the Jackson Heights – Roosevelt Avenue subway station and bus terminal."
    }
